{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UCGRTkR2kN16KZMZ5RD4JS","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — schema-dag-extraction\\\\n\\\\n## Blackwell GPU vLLM 启动必须设 VLLM_ATTENTION_BACKEND (2026-05-15)\\\\n- RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 上 vLLM 启动新模型时必须 `export VLLM_ATTENTION_BACKEND=FLASH_ATTN`，否则 engine core init 失败\\\\n- exp-012 r1 因此崩溃，GPU 空闲 ~35 分钟。已在 `scripts/run_exp012_llama.sh` 中修复\\\\n- **所有新脚本都应包含此环境变量**\\\\n\\\\n## FewRel 80-rel Scaling Effect (2026-05-15) ⭐⭐\\\\n- 80-rel degradation 35.3pp vs 16-rel 12.6pp (2.8x)，BCS effect -31.2pp vs -9.1pp (3.4x amplification)\\\\n- **Insight**: relation space 大小是 confusability effect 的 multiplier，不只是 additive\\\\n- EXIT_CODE=129 是 SIGHUP（SSH 断连），实验实际跑完了。**教训**：非 submit_training_job 启动的实验没有 tmux 保护会被 SSH 断连杀死\\\\n\\\\n## exp-007 Error Taxonomy (2026-05-15) ⭐⭐\\\\n- IntraSub vs BCS: Spearman ρ=1.0 (p<0.001)，BCS≥0.95 时 49.4% FP 是 batch 内类型混淆\\\\n- Hallucination + boundary <3%。**LLM 主要错误模式是 type confusion 而非幻觉**\\\\n- Claim 2 最强 mechanistic evidence\\\\n\\\\n## exp-008 SDGD-zero NEGATIVE → v2 设计完成 (2026-05-15) ⭐⭐\\\\n**v1 Hypothesis rejected**: SDGD-zero union merge 不可行，merge amplification 是根因。\\\\n\\\\n| Mode | F1 | Precision | Recall | Δ vs baseline |\\\\n|------|-----|-----------|--------|---------------|\\\\n| single_pass | 0.4451 | 0.5631 | 0.3679 | baseline |\\\\n| random_batch | 0.3197 | 0.2491 | 0.4462 | -0.1253 |\\\\n| per_type | 0.2915 | 0.1940 | 0.5856 | -0.1536 |\\\\n| sdgd_zero | 0.2514 | 0.2096 | 0.3141 | -0.1937 |\\\\n\\\\n**诊断根因**：\\\\n- 小 batch (3 types) over-predict 4.4x (FP 90%)，大 batch (18 types) 0.6x\\\\n- 54.6% span 跨 batch 标为不同类型（union merge 系统缺陷，random 同样 58%）\\\\n- 问题不在 SDGD 分组逻辑，在 merge 策略\\\\n\\\\n**SDGD v2 改进（已实现，待 GPU 验证）**：\\\\n1. **min_batch_size=8**: 8 batches [18,12,11,7,7,5,3,3] → 4 batches [19,18,15,14]，灾难 batch 消除\\\\n2. **Confidence-gated merge**: logprobs=1, normalized confidence = cumulative_logprob/n_tokens, threshold filtering 替代 union merge\\\\n3. 启动脚本: `scripts/run_sdgd_v2_fewnerd.sh` + `scripts/run_sdgd_v2_maven_minilm.sh`\\\\n\\\\n**教训**: 减少 schema 确实提升 recall (per_type 0.59)，但 precision 与 batch 数量强负相关。batch-exclusive extraction 留 future work。\\\\n\\\\n## D010 Embedding Ablation — FULL 2×3 Matrix (2026-05-15) ⭐⭐\\\\n\\\\n### Per-type F1 vs mean BCS (Layer 2)\\\\n| | Few-NERD (NER, cross-domain) | FewRel (RE, cross-domain) | MAVEN (ED, same-domain) |\\\\n|---|---|---|---|\\\\n| **Qwen3** | ρ=-0.293 (p=0.020) ✓ | pending | ρ=+0.189 (p=0.021) ✗ |\\\\n| **MiniLM** | ρ=+0.005 (p=0.969) ✗ | Δ=21-50pp (extreme) ✓ | ρ=+0.208 (p=0.011) ✗ |\\\\n\\\\n### Pairwise SCS vs Confusion (Layer 1)\\\\n| | Few-NERD | MAVEN |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| **Qwen3** | r=0.156 (p=4.6e-12) ✓ | r=-0.007 (p=0.41) ✗ |\\\\n| **MiniLM** | not computed | r=+0.120 (p≈0), nonzero ρ=0.191 ✓ |\\\\n\\\\n### 核心解读\\\\n1. **Per-type 正方向 on MAVEN 不是 embedding compression** — MiniLM（无压缩）也是正方向。是 MAVEN type centrality confound\\\\n2. **Pairwise confusability 信号存在于 MAVEN** — MiniLM pairwise r=+0.12 (p≈0)\\\\n3. **Extraction model alignment**: Qwen3 在 Few-NERD per-type 有效，MAVEN 无效；MiniLM 反过来\\\\n4. **SDGD v2 用 MiniLM pairwise 在 MAVEN 上有理论基础**\\\\n\\\\n## D008 证据层级 (2026-05-15, FINAL)\\\\n1. **Layer 1 (Primary) — Pairwise BCS-confusion**: r=0.156 (p=4.6e-12, n=1953); ρ=0.254 (p=1.1e-6)\\\\n2. **Layer 2 (Supporting) — Per-type F1 vs BCS**: ρ=-0.293 (p=0.020); Quartile Δ=-8.2pp\\\\n3. **Layer 3 (Discussion) — Batch-level**: F1-BCS 正相关（frequency artifact）\\\\n\\\\n## FewRel Pilot PASS (2026-05-15) ⭐\\\\n- Δ=-20.9pp (count_4), -50.0pp (count_8), -48.6pp (count_16)\\\\n- MiniLM embedding, extreme batch comparison\\\\n\\\\n## D005 Narrative: Multi-channel Degradation\\\\n- Count → recall decline (0.72→0.42)\\\\n- Confusability → type confusion (pairwise + per-type evidence)\\\\n\\\\n## FewRel Qwen3 Embeddings (2026-05-15)\\\\n- 80 relations, dim=5120 (bfloat16)\\\\n- BCS mean=0.879, std=0.073 (高于 Few-NERD，relations 语义更接近)\\\\n- artifacts/fewrel_qwen3_embeddings.pt + sim_matrix.pt\\\\n\\\\n## Multi-model 决策 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **LLaMA-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8** (nvidia/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8)\\\\n- 15/15 分片下载完成，72.7GB 已验证\\\\n\\\\n## SDGD 设计决策 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **阈值**: adaptive (mean + k·std)，k 唯一超参\\\\n- **SDGD-cal**: calibrate.py 已实现，RE 解析已修复\\\\n- **MAVEN MiniLM**: 168×168 sim matrix, 18→4 batches (v2 min_batch_size=8)\\\\n\\\\n## 数据集 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **Few-NERD**: NER, 66 types。**Qwen3 per-type ✓, pairwise ✓**\\\\n- **MAVEN**: ED, 168 types。**MiniLM pairwise ✓ (r=0.12)**, per-type centrality confound\\\\n- **FewRel**: RE, 80 relations。**MiniLM extreme ✓ (Δ=21-50pp)**\\\\n\\\\n## 文献 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- 25+ 篇 + 5 篇 anisotropy/degeneration\\\\n- **无人做过 same-domain type embedding compression in IE** — 首次实证\\\\n\\\\n## Environment (2026-05-14)\\\\n- cqa1-38874: RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB, CUDA 13.1\\\\n- conda base: Python 3.12.3, vLLM 0.20.2, torch 2.10.0+cu128\\\\n- Qwen3-32B-FP8 at /root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/qwen3-32b-fp8/\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4456, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01P4BXChci23qFpkMsGSnMGk","session_id":"a149a487-31d1-4670-8142-477477103f8e","uuid":"e3ef5394-be84-46ae-bae6-0a801e47845b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:52:22.581Z"}
